# ManageRoles ERP — Complete Development Blueprint

> **Purpose**: This document provides a **complete, detailed blueprint** of every page in the ManageRoles ERP system (all 58 controllers). For each page, it covers: workflow, input fields, field purposes, user flow, backend interactions, and recommended technologies for re-implementation.

---

