## 1. System Architecture Overview

### 1.1 Current Architecture (ASP.NET MVC)

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Presentation Layer"
        V["Views - Razor .cshtml"]
        JS["jQuery + DataTables.js"]
    end
    subgraph "Application Layer"
        C["Controllers - 58 total"]
        VM["ViewModels - 71 classes"]
        F["Filters - Authorization"]
        AM["AutoMapper"]
    end
    subgraph "Data Layer"
        R["Repository Interfaces + Concrete"]
        DB["DatabaseContext - EF6"]
        SP["Stored Procedures"]
    end
    subgraph "Database"
        SQL["SQL Server 2022"]
    end
    V --> C
    JS --> C
    C --> VM
    C --> AM
    AM --> R
    R --> DB
    DB --> SQL
    SP --> SQL
```

### 1.2 Four-Layer Project Structure

| Project | Purpose | Size |
|---|---|---|
| **ManageRoles** | Main web app — Controllers, Views, Scripts, Filters | 58 controllers |
| **ManageRoles.Models** | Entity classes mapped to DB tables | 144 model files |
| **ManageRoles.Repository** | Data access — interfaces + concrete | 117 files |
| **ManageRoles.ViewModels** | DTOs, form validation, view binding | 71 ViewModel files |

### 1.3 Cross-Cutting Concerns

| Concern | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Authentication** | Session-based (`Session["UserID"]`, `Session["Username"]`, `Session["Role"]`) |
| **Authorization** | Custom filter `[AuthorizeSuperAdminandAdmin]` checks session role |
| **Password Security** | AES encryption via `AesAlgorithm` class |
| **Audit Trail** | IP, MAC, DeviceName, WindowsUsername logged on every CUD operation |
| **ORM** | Entity Framework 6 with `DatabaseContext` (+ `InvoiceDbContext` for invoices) |
| **Object Mapping** | AutoMapper for Model ↔ ViewModel conversions |
| **Server-side Paging** | jQuery DataTables + jTable for server-side processing |
| **CAPTCHA** | `CaptchaMvc` on login page |
| **Reporting** | Crystal Reports (`CrystalDecisions`) for quotation/invoice PDFs |
| **File Handling** | Image/PDF upload to `~/Content/images/` and `~/Content/pdfs/` |
| **Logging** | NLog for error and event logging |
| **Soft Delete** | Records marked as deleted (status = "D") with UnDelete capability |

