## 3. User & Role Management Module

### 3.1 Create Users Page (Admin-Created)

**Route**: `GET/POST /CreateUsers/Create`  
**Authorization**: `[AuthorizeSuperAdminandAdmin]`

**Workflow**:
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["Admin opens Create User page"] --> B["Form pre-loaded with Role dropdown"]
    B --> C["Fill Username, Password, Email, Role"]
    C --> D{"Submit"}
    D --> E{"Username already exists?"}
    E -->|Yes| F["Show 'Username already exists'"]
    E -->|No| G["Create Usermaster record — CreatedBy = Session UserID"]
    G --> H["Encrypt password via AES"]
    H --> I["Save PasswordMaster"]
    I --> J["Create SavedAssignedRoles — link user to selected role"]
    J --> K["Show 'User Created Successfully'"]
```

**Input Fields**:

| Field | Type | Required | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `UserName` | text | ✅ | Login username for new user |
| `FirstName` | text | ✅ | User's first name |
| `LastName` | text | ✅ | User's last name |
| `EmailId` | email | ✅ | User's email address |
| `MobileNo` | text | ✅ | User's mobile number |
| `Gender` | text | ✅ | User's gender |
| `Password` | password | ✅ | Login password (AES encrypted) |
| `ConfirmPassword` | password | ✅ | Must match Password |
| `RoleId` | dropdown | ✅ | Role (from `IRole.GetAllActiveRoles()`) |

**Backend**: `IUserMaster`, `IPassword`, `ISavedAssignedRoles`, `IRole`

### 3.2 All Users Page (View & Delete Users)

**Route**: `GET /AllUsers/Show`  
**Authorization**: `[AuthorizeSuperAdminandAdmin]`

**Workflow**: Uses **jTable** (not DataTables) — different pagination library  
- `POST /AllUsers/UserList` — Returns paginated user list with sorting
- `POST /AllUsers/RemoveUser?userId=` — Deletes user + password + role assignment

**Table Columns**: UserId, UserName, FirstName, LastName, EmailId, Gender, Status, MobileNo

> [!WARNING]
> **SuperAdmin cannot be deleted.** The `RemoveUser` action checks if the user's role matches `SuperAdminRolekey` from config. If so, returns error: "Cannot Delete Super Admin".

**Delete Cascade**: Removes from 3 tables: `Usermasters` → `PasswordMaster` → `SavedAssignedRoles`

### 3.3 Role Master Page

**Route**: `/RoleMaster/*` — Full CRUD  
**Purpose**: Manage system roles (SuperAdmin, Admin, User). Standard DataTable + Create/Edit/Delete pattern.

### 3.4 Menu Management

| Page | Route | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Menu Masters** | `/MenuMasters/*` | Define top-level navigation menu items (e.g., "Masters", "Sales", "Inventory") |
| **SubMenu Masters** | `/SubMenuMaster/*` | Define sub-items under each menu (e.g., "Item Master" under "Masters"). Has `MenuId` dropdown linking to parent menu. |

### 3.5 Role-Based Access Control

| Page | Route | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Assign Roles to Menu** | `/AssignRolestoMenu/*` | Control which roles see which top-level menu items |
| **Assign Roles to SubMenu** | `/AssignRolestoSubMenu/*` | Control which roles see which sub-menu items |
| **Assign Role to User** | `/AssignRoletoUser/*` | Assign a role to a specific user |
| **Edit Assigned Roles** | `/EditAssignedRoles/*` | Modify existing user-role assignments |
| **All Assigned Role Menu** | `/AllAssignedRoleMenu/*` | View all menu-role assignments with jTable pagination |
| **All Assigned Role SubMenu** | `/AllAssignedRoleSubMenu/*` | View all submenu-role assignments with jTable pagination |
| **All Roles** | `/AllRoles/*` | View all role records |

