## 4. Dashboard Module

### 4.1 Super Admin Dashboard

**Route**: `GET /SuperDashboard/Dashboard`  
**Authorization**: `[AuthorizeSuperAdminandAdmin]`

**Features**:
- Shows main dashboard view
- `ShowMenus()` renders menus via `PartialView("ShowMenu")` using `IMenu.GetAllActiveMenuSuperAdmin()`
- Has error handling — displays friendly error view if menus fail to load

### 4.2 Admin Dashboard

**Route**: `GET /AdminDashboard/Dashboard`  
**Authorization**: `[AuthorizeSuperAdminandAdmin]`
- Renders same dashboard layout but with admin-specific menu filtering

### 4.3 User Dashboard

**Route**: `GET /UserDashboard/Dashboard`  
- Standard user view with limited menu items based on role assignments

