## 5. Masters Module

### 5.1 Company Master Page

**Route**: `GET/POST /CompanyMaster/Create`, `/CompanyMaster/Edit/{id}`, `/CompanyMaster/Delete/{id}`

**Workflow**:
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["Index: DataTable listing all companies"] --> B["Click 'Add New'"]
    B --> C["Create form with tabbed sections"]
    C --> D["Fill company details"]
    D --> E{"Validate: Company Name unique?"}
    E -->|No| F["Show 'Duplicate' error"]
    E -->|Yes| G["Auto-generate Company Code via GetCCode()"]
    G --> H["AutoMapper → CompanyMasterNew entity"]
    H --> I["Save via AddCompanyMasterNew()"]
    I --> J["Show 'Created Successfully'"]
```

**Input Fields** (organized by section):

#### Section 1: Basic Info
| Field | Type | Required | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `CompanyCode` | text | ✅ | Auto-generated unique company identifier |
| `CompanyName` | text | ✅ | Full legal company name |
| `CompanyTypeId` | dropdown | ✅ | Type (from `CompanyTypeMaster`) with custom `CompanyTypeValidate` |

#### Section 2: Address (11 fields)
| Field | Type | Required | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `DoorNumber` | text | ✅ | Building/door number |
| `Street` | text | ✅ | Street name |
| `Place` | text | ✅ | Place/locality |
| `Post` | text | ✅ | Post office |
| `City` | text | ✅ | City name |
| `Taluk` | text | ✅ | Taluk/sub-district |
| `District` | text | ✅ | District name |
| `DistrictCode` | number | ✅ | Numeric district code |
| `State` | text | ✅ | State name |
| `StateCode` | number | ✅ | State code (for GST) |
| `Country` | text | ✅ | Country name |
| `PinCode` | text | ✅ | Postal/ZIP code |
| `FullAddress` | textarea | ✅ | Complete address (stored as `varbinary`) |

#### Section 3: Tax & Legal
| Field | Type | Required | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GSTIN` | text | ✅ | GST Identification Number (15-char) |
| `PanNo` | text | ✅ | PAN card number |

#### Section 4: Contact Details — 5 departments × 3 fields = 15 fields
Each department (Company, Marketing, Purchase, Sales, Service):
- `{Dept}PhoneNumber` (text, ✅)
- `{Dept}EMailId` (email, ✅)
- `{Dept}WebsiteURL` (url, ✅)

#### Section 5: Bank Details (11 fields)
| Field | Type | Required | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `BankAccountType` | text | ✅ | Savings/Current |
| `BankAccountName` | text | ✅ | Account holder name |
| `BankAccountNumber` | text | ✅ | Account number |
| `BankName` | text | ✅ | Bank name |
| `BankIFSCCode` | text | ✅ | IFSC for NEFT/RTGS |
| `BankMICRCode` | text | ✅ | MICR code |
| `BankBranch` | text | ✅ | Branch name |
| `BankDistrict` | text | ✅ | Branch district |
| `BankState` | text | ✅ | Branch state |
| `BankPinCode` | text | ✅ | Branch PIN |
| `BankCountry` | text | ✅ | Branch country |
| `BankFullAddress` | textarea | ✅ | Complete bank address |

#### Section 6: Branding
| Field | Type | Required | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `CLogoImagePath` | file | ✅ | Company logo upload |
| `Status` | select | ✅ | Active/Inactive |

**Total: ~50 input fields**

**Backend**: `ICompanyMaster` → `CompanyMasterConcrete` → `DatabaseContext.CompanyMasterNew`

