### 5.8 Vehicle Master Page

**Route**: `/VehicleMaster/Create`, `/Delete/{id}`

**Workflow**:
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["Select Customer from dropdown"] --> B["AJAX: GetCustomerDetails(customerId)"]
    B --> C["Auto-fill: Address, State, Contact info"]
    C --> D["AJAX: GetVehicleCountDetails(customerId)"]
    D --> E["Display vehicle count for customer"]
    E --> F["Select Vehicle Model → AJAX: GetMaxSno(modelNo)"]
    F --> G["Auto-generate Serial Number based on financial year"]
    G --> H["Select Sub-type, Vehicle Name, BOM Type"]
    H --> I["Submit → Capture audit info → Save"]
```

| Field | Type | Required | Source | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `Customer_Id` | dropdown | ✅ | `CustomerMaster` (AJAX auto-fill) | Customer link |
| `Vehicle_Model_No_Id` | dropdown | ✅ | `VehicleModelNumberMaster` | Vehicle model |
| `Model_Sub_Type_Id` | dropdown | ✅ | `VehicleSubTypeMaster` | Model variant |
| `Vehicle_Name_Id` | dropdown | ✅ | `VehicleNameMaster` | Vehicle name |
| `Serial_No` | text | auto | AJAX: `GetMaxSno()` | Auto serial via stored proc |
| `Vehicle_No` | text | — | — | Registration plate |
| `Customer_Vehicle_Count` | number | auto | AJAX: `GetVehicleCountDetails()` | Running count |
| `BOM_Type` | select | ✅ | — | Bill of Materials type |
| `Model_Row_Id` | dropdown | — | `VehicleIndexModelNumberMaster` | BOM model link |
| `Remarks` | textarea | — | — | Notes |

**Serial Number Logic**: `GetMaxSnoPartNumber(modelNo)` — Queries SQL view filtered by vehicle model and Indian financial year (Apr-Mar), returns MAX + 1.

**Backend**: `IVehicleMaster`, `ICustomerMaster`

