## 6. Sales Module (Quotation)

### 6.1 Quotation Index

**Route**: `GET /Quotation/Index`

**Filter Fields**:

| Field | Type | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `FromDate` | date | Start date (default: -7 days) |
| `ToDate` | date | End date (default: today) |
| `QueryPo` | text | Search by PO/Quotation number |
| `QuotationConfirmedStatusId` | dropdown | Status filter |

### 6.2 Quotation Create/Edit ⭐ (Second Most Complex)

**Route**: `GET/POST /Quotation/Create`, `/Quotation/Edit/{id}`

**Workflow**:
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["Auto-generate Quotation No: FY/QXXXXX"] --> B["Select Customer → AJAX auto-fill address/GSTIN"]
    B --> C["Set Tax Type, Currency, Exchange Rate"]
    C --> D["Add line items via Item Master popup"]
    D --> E["Per item: Qty × Price - Discount + GST"]
    E --> F["SGST/CGST/IGST split based on Tax Type"]
    F --> G["Calculate totals → Submit"]
    G --> H["Save QuotationEntry + QuotationDetails"]
```

**Master Header Fields** (20 fields):

| Field | Type | Required | Source | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `PO_No` | text | auto | `YY-YY/QXXXXX` | Quotation number |
| `PODate` | date | ✅ | Default: today | Quotation date |
| `Customer_ID` | dropdown | ✅ | Customer list | Customer |
| `Contact_Person` | text | — | Auto-filled | Contact |
| `Contact_No` | text | — | Auto-filled | Phone |
| `LM_Address1–5` | text | auto | Auto-filled | Address |
| `CustomerRefNo` | text | — | — | Customer ref |
| `Revision_No` | number | — | — | Revision # |
| `Delivery_Date` | date | ✅ | — | Delivery date |
| `Validity_Until` | text | — | — | Validity period |
| `GSTTIN` | text | auto | Auto-filled | Customer GSTIN |
| `QuotationTypeId` | dropdown | ✅ | `QuotationTypeMaster` | Type |
| `GradeId` | dropdown | ✅ | `QuotationGradeMaster` | Model/grade |
| `TaxTypeId` | dropdown | ✅ | `QuotationTaxTypeMaster` | Local/Interstate |
| `TaxId` | dropdown | ✅ | Tax % list | GST % |
| `CurrencyTypeId` | dropdown | ✅ | `QuotationCurrencyTypeMaster` | Currency |
| `Exchange_Rate` | decimal | — | — | Exchange rate |
| `Payment_Terms` | textarea | — | `TermsCondition` table | Terms |
| `PdfFile` | file | — | — | Attachment |

**Line Item Fields** (per row):

| Field | Type | Calc? | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `Item_ID` | lookup | — | Item from popup |
| `Item_Code` | text | auto | Part number |
| `Item_Name` | text | auto | Part name |
| `HSN_Code` | text | auto | HSN code |
| `UOM` | text | auto | Unit |
| `Qty` | decimal | — | Quantity |
| `Unit_Price` | decimal | — | Price per unit |
| `Disc_Per` | decimal | — | Discount % |
| `Desc_Amt` | decimal | ✅ | Discount amount |
| `Final_Price` | decimal | ✅ | After discount |
| `Sub_total` | decimal | ✅ | Qty × Final Price |
| `GST_Per` | decimal | auto | GST % |
| `SGST/CGST/IGST` | decimal | ✅ | Tax split |
| `GST_Amt` | decimal | ✅ | Tax amount |
| `Net_Amt` | decimal | ✅ | Total with tax |

**Summary Calculations**:

| Field | Formula |
|---|---|
| `Total_Before_Disc` | Σ line sub-totals |
| `Sdiscount` | Flat discount |
| `Freight_Amount` | Shipping |
| `Packing_Forward` | Packing charges |
| `Taxable_Amount` | Before tax total |
| `IGST/SGST/CGST Amounts` | By tax type |
| `Net_Amt` | Grand total |

**AJAX Endpoints**:
- `GET /Quotation/GetItemData?itemId=&gstType=` — Item details
- `GET /Quotation/ListJson?search=&groupId=` — Item search
- `GET /Quotation/Image/{id}` — Item image stream

**Backend**: `IQuotationRepository`, Crystal Reports for PDF

