## 9. Configuration Module

### 9.1 Reference Group Master (Dropdown Categories)

**Route**: `/ReferenceGroupMaster/Create`, Edit, Delete, **UnDelete**  
**Authorization**: `[AuthorizeSuperAdminandAdmin]`

> [!TIP]
> Reference Groups define **dropdown categories**. Each group (e.g., "Department", "Designation") contains multiple values managed via Reference Group Value Master.

**Workflow**:
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["Index: Active groups in DataTable"] --> B["Create: Enter group code"]
    B --> C{"Unique? — AJAX: CheckReferenceGroup"}
    C -->|Duplicate| D["Error"]
    C -->|Unique| E["Save with audit trail"]
    A --> F["UDIndex: View deleted groups"]
    F --> G["UnDelete: Restore soft-deleted group"]
```

| Field | Type | Required | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `RG_vCode` | text | ✅ | Group code/name |
| `RG_vDescription` | auto | — | Auto-set = RG_vCode |
| `RG_vStatus` | auto | — | "A" on create |

**Special**: Soft delete with **UnDelete** capability

### 9.2 Reference Group Value Master (Dropdown Values)

**Route**: `/ReferenceGroupValue/Create`, Edit, Delete  
**Authorization**: `[AuthorizeSuperAdminandAdmin]`

**Workflow**:
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["Create: Select Reference Group from dropdown"] --> B["Enter Value Code + Description"]
    B --> C{"Unique? — AJAX: CheckReferenceGroupValue"}
    C -->|Duplicate| D["Error"]
    C -->|Unique| E["Save: RGV_iRG_ID links to parent group"]
    E --> F["TempData preserves SelectedRG_ID for next entry"]
```

| Field | Type | Required | Source | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `RG_iID` | dropdown | ✅ | `ReferenceGroupMaster` | Parent group |
| `RGV_vCode` | text | ✅ | — | Value code |
| `RGV_vDesciption` | text | ✅ | — | Value description (trimmed) |

**AJAX Endpoints**:
- `GET /ReferenceGroupValue/GetVCode?id=` — Fetch next code
- `GET /ReferenceGroupValue/GetRecordsByReferenceGroup?id=` — Filter values by group
- `GET /ReferenceGroupValue/CheckReferenceGroupValue?refgroupName=` — Duplicate check

**Backend**: `IReferenceGroupValue`, `IReferenceGroupMaster`

