## 10. Inventory & Part Number Module

### 10.1 Item Group Master

**Route**: `/ItemGroupMaster/Create`, Edit, Delete, **UnDelete**  
**Authorization**: `[AuthorizeSuperAdminandAdmin]`

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This page manages item groups — the top-level classification for all items. Each group links to a **Store** and a **Part Number Prefix** that controls auto-generation of part numbers. The controller is 644 lines and uses concurrency handling (`DbUpdateConcurrencyException`) on edit.

| Field | Type | Required | Source | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `IM_PartName` | text | ✅ | — | Group/part name |
| `StoreId` | dropdown | ✅ | `ItemStoreMaster` | Default store |
| `PrefixId` | dropdown | ✅ | `ItemGroupMasterFormatedPrefix` | Part number prefix |

**Special Features**:
- **Soft Delete + UnDelete**: `DeleteItemMaster1()` / `UnDeleteItemMaster()`
- **Concurrency Control**: Handles `DbUpdateConcurrencyException` with retry loop
- **Duplicate Check**: `CheckItemGroup` AJAX endpoint
- **Deleted Items View**: `UDIndex` page + `LoadallItemGroupMasterDeleted`

**Backend**: `IItemGroupMaster`, `IItemMaster`, `IPartNumberBaseMasterConcrete`

### 10.2 Part Number Base Master

**Route**: `/PartNumberBaseMaster/Create`, Edit, Details

**Purpose**: Define part number structures with 3 cascading dropdowns.

| Field | Type | Required | Source | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `CategoryId` | dropdown | ✅ | `PartNumberCategoryMaster` | Category |
| `SubCategoryId` | dropdown | ✅ | `PartNumberBaseSubCategoryMaster` | Sub-category |
| `PrefixId` | dropdown | ✅ | `PartNumberBasePrefixMaster` | Prefix |

**Backend**: `IPartNumberBaseMasterConcrete`, `IPartNumberCatagoryMaster`, `IPartNumberSubCatagoryMaster`, `IPartNumberPrefixMaster`

