## 13. Migration Technology Recommendations

### 13.1 Recommended New Stack

| Layer | Current | Recommended | Rationale |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Frontend** | jQuery + Razor | React 19 + Vite 7 | SPA, component reuse |
| **CSS** | Bootstrap (implied) | TailwindCSS v4 | Utility-first design system |
| **State** | Server-side Session | React Context + useReducer | Client-side state |
| **Backend API** | ASP.NET MVC Controllers | ASP.NET Core 8 Web API | REST, JSON |
| **ORM** | Entity Framework 6 | EF Core 8 | Modern, migrations |
| **Database** | SQL Server 2022 | SQL Server 2022 (keep) | Proven |
| **Auth** | Session + AES | JWT + bcrypt | Stateless |
| **Files** | Local filesystem | Azure Blob / local | Scalable |
| **Reports** | Crystal Reports | React-PDF / Puppeteer | Modern PDF |

