### 13.4 Common Patterns for Migration

#### A. Server-Side DataTable Pattern (Used in 30+ controllers)
```
1. Extract: draw, start, length, sortColumn, sortDir, searchValue
2. Call: repository.ShowAll{Entity}(sort, dir, search)
3. Apply: .Skip(start).Take(length)
4. Return: { draw, recordsFiltered, recordsTotal, data }
```
**→ Replace with**: `GET /api/{entity}?page=1&size=10&sort=name&dir=asc&search=term`

#### B. Audit Trail Pattern (Used in all CUD operations)
```
IP → Request.UserHostAddress
MAC → SystemInfo table lookup by IP
DeviceName → SystemInfo table lookup by IP  
Username → SystemInfo table lookup by IP
```
**→ Replace with**: JWT claims (userId, role) + Request middleware (IP, user-agent)

#### C. Dropdown Validation Pattern (Custom `ValidationAttribute`)
```csharp
if (Convert.ToString(value) == "-1") 
    return new ValidationResult("Choose XYZ");
```
**→ Replace with**: `zod.number().min(1, "Choose XYZ")`

#### D. Soft Delete + UnDelete Pattern (Used on 4 entities)
```
Delete: Status = "D" + capture D-audit fields (DIPAddress, DMACAddress, etc.)
UnDelete: Status = "A" + clear D-audit fields
```
**→ Replace with**: `DELETE /api/{entity}/{id}` (soft) + `PATCH /api/{entity}/{id}/restore`

#### E. Duplicate Check Pattern (Used on 8+ entities)
```
AJAX GET: Check{Entity}(name) → returns bool
```
**→ Replace with**: `GET /api/{entity}/check?name=` → `{ exists: true/false }`

---

> **This blueprint documents all 58 controllers and 54+ pages in the ManageRoles ERP system.** Every page follows MVC patterns with Controller → ViewModel → AutoMapper → Repository → EF6 → SQL Server, using consistent audit trailing, server-side DataTables, dropdown cascading, and soft-delete patterns throughout.
